At the moment I count 6 languages I can have a conversation with, though I'm only really fluent in 2.

- **Fluent:** Portuguese and English;
- **Semi-fluent:**:Spanish;
- **Basic conversation:** Japanese and German;
- **Even more basic:** French.

I'm learning Russian too, but it's not yet enough to have an unbroken conversation. 
By the time I cross France, I expect my French will have improved to the same level as my German. After that, I will be learning a bit of the languages of the countries I walk by. Expect regular updates to this answer ;)
